我想她一定是感受到妈妈是很爱她的
wǒ xiǎng tā yí dìng shì gǎn shòu dào mā ma shì hěn ài tā de
I think she must have felt that her mother loved her very much.

255
00:11:43,866 --> 00:11:45,366
很关心她的
hěn guān xīn tā de
She cares about her a lot

256
00:11:45,766 --> 00:11:47,700
她也很爱她的妈妈
tā yě hěn ài tā de mā ma
She also loves her mother very much.

257
00:11:48,566 --> 00:11:50,766
她在脱口秀里说
tā zài tuō kǒu xiù lǐ shuō
She said in her talk show

258
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:55,633
现在她在成都的郊区买了一个房子
xiàn zài tā zài chéng dū de jiāo qū mǎi le yí gè fáng zi
She has now bought a house in the suburbs of Chengdu.

259
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:58,566
和妈妈生活在一起
hé mā ma shēng huó zài yì qǐ
Living with my mother

260
00:11:59,566 --> 00:12:01,500
那平时的王越呢
nà píng shí de wáng yuè ne
What about Wang Yue normally?

261
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:04,400
经常要讲脱口秀
jīng cháng yào jiǎng tuō kǒu xiù
I often have to do stand-up comedy

262
00:12:04,433 --> 00:12:07,833
所以会去中国的很多地方
suǒ yǐ huì qù zhōng guó de hěn duō dì fang
So I will go to many places in China

263
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:10,466
然后呢赚了钱
rán hòu ne zhuàn le qián
And then I made money.

264
00:12:10,466 --> 00:12:11,966
她会存钱
tā huì cún qián
She saves money.

265
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:14,500
妈妈看到她存钱
mā ma kàn dào tā cún qián
Mom saw her saving money

266
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,300
觉得很奇怪
jué de hěn qí guài
It feels very strange

267
00:12:16,633 --> 00:12:18,166
你为什么要存钱
nǐ wèi shén me yào cún qián
Why do you save money?

268
00:12:18,366 --> 00:12:20,033
是不是和我一样
shì bú shì hé wǒ yí yàng
Is it the same as me?

269
00:12:20,066 --> 00:12:21,300
你要逃跑
nǐ yào táo pǎo
You want to run away

270
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:24,500
妈妈有一点担心呢
mā ma yǒu yì diǎn dān xīn ne
Mom is a little worried.

271
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,633
王越就跟她妈妈说
wáng yuè jiù gēn tā mā ma shuō
Wang Yue then told her mother

272
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:27,966
在这个家里
zài zhè gè jiā lǐ
In this home

273
00:12:27,966 --> 00:12:30,400
没有人需要再逃跑了
méi yǒu rén xū yào zài táo pǎo le
No one needs to run away anymore.

274
00:12:31,033 --> 00:12:31,966
这句话呢
zhè jù huà ne
This sentence

275
00:12:31,966 --> 00:12:33,600
听起来很简单
tīng qǐ lái hěn jiǎn dān
It sounds simple

276
00:12:33,766 --> 00:12:35,700
但是对她们母女来说
dàn shì duì tā men mǔ nǚ lái shuō
But for them, mother and daughter

277
00:12:35,700 --> 00:12:38,300
是一句非常有意义的话
shì yí jù fēi cháng yǒu yì yì de huà
It is a very meaningful statement.

278
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:39,300
OK
OK
OK

279
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:43,566
那王越的脱口秀我就给你讲完了
nà wáng yuè de tuō kǒu xiù wǒ jiù gěi nǐ jiǎng wán le
That concludes my retelling of Wang Yue's stand-up comedy.

280
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:46,633
这个是她在脱口秀里讲的
zhè gè shì tā zài tuō kǒu xiù lǐ jiǎng de
This is something she said on a talk show.

281
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,800
她的故事你听懂了吗
tā de gù shi nǐ tīng dǒng le ma
Did you understand her story?

282
00:12:50,466 --> 00:12:54,066
如果你也和我一样喜欢她的故事
rú guǒ nǐ yě hé wǒ yí yàng xǐ huān tā de gù shi
If you also like her story as much as I do

283
00:12:54,233 --> 00:12:57,300
我建议你去看看她的脱口秀
wǒ jiàn yì nǐ qù kàn kan tā de tuō kǒu xiù
I suggest you check out her stand-up comedy.

284
00:12:57,300 --> 00:12:59,700
你现在应该会听得懂
nǐ xiàn zài yīng gāi huì tīng de dǒng
You should be able to understand now.

285
00:13:00,033 --> 00:13:03,900
那我把这个链接放在视频的下面
nà wǒ bǎ zhè gè liàn jiē fàng zài shì pín de xià miàn
I'll put this link below the video.

286
00:13:04,033 --> 00:13:06,466
非常建议你去看一看
fēi cháng jiàn yì nǐ qù kàn yí kàn
I highly recommend you take a look.

287
00:13:07,233 --> 00:13:09,166
我看完她的脱口秀呢
wǒ kàn wán tā de tuō kǒu xiù ne
I watched her stand-up comedy show.

288
00:13:09,166 --> 00:13:11,033
也是非常感动
yě shì fēi cháng gǎn dòng
I was also very moved.

289
00:13:11,300 --> 00:13:13,600
所以我也想通过这个视频
suǒ yǐ wǒ yě xiǎng tōng guò zhè gè shì pín
So I also wanted to use this video

290
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:17,833
向世界上的所有的女人致敬
xiàng shì jiè shàng de suǒ yǒu de nǚ rén zhì jìng
A tribute to all women in the world

291
00:13:18,100 --> 00:13:21,700
不管她们做非常重要的工作
bù guǎn tā men zuò fēi cháng zhòng yào de gōng zuò
No matter how important their work is

292
00:13:21,766 --> 00:13:24,233
还是在家里照顾孩子
hái shì zài jiā lǐ zhào gù hái zi
Still taking care of the children at home

293
00:13:24,233 --> 00:13:25,633
做家庭主妇
zuò jiā tíng zhǔ fù
Being a housewife

294
00:13:25,866 --> 00:13:28,833
我觉得都是非常伟大的
wǒ jué de dōu shì fēi cháng wěi dà de
I think they are all very great.

295
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:30,700
非常了不起的
fēi cháng liǎo bù qǐ de
Absolutely amazing

